        {
            "title": "Oonky Revolution: Tweaks & Fixes - Playtest v0.9.0.34",
            "date": "2025-07-13 16:10:21",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1805065414309946",
            "content": "[p][b]Collecting money at the end of the round is too annoying (especially since the amount of money increases).[/b][/p][list][*][p]Clients drop money occasionally[/p][/*][*][p]An oonky kill earns more money[/p][/*][/list][p][b]Reload is too much of a handicap.[/b][/p][list][*][p]Auto reload toggle in controls[/p][/*][*][p]Reload can now be cancelled by a melee attack and by switching items.[/p][/*][/list][p][b]The plane is unusable due to its immobility.[/b][/p][list][*][p]The has fine controls now![/p][/*][/list][p][/p][p]Furthermore, I have changed \"Public Fight\" into \"Oonky Revolution\" and I have added some lore as a description on the host menu.[/p]"
        },
