            "content": "Hello Playtesters!\n\nMany of you haven't joined the Discord server yet and haven't posted anything about your 2vs2 playtesting experiences. This means I can't learn about the game's stability. The goal of playtesting is to gather information about the game's state and the bugs it still contains. With this information the game can be improved accordingly so that it eventually becomes ready to release as a main non-playtesting game build.\n\nThanks for testing and your interest, and I hope you will help me by sharing your test results!\n\nDiscord Server: [url=https://discord.gg/hUbzJCDXD2]discord.gg/hUbzJCDXD2[/url]"
